# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  ftequakers fork additions.  Kept at the END of the file so that merges from
#  upstream never conflict with them.
#
#  NOTE: this fork deliberately has NO .gitattributes.  346 files in this
#  history are committed with CRLF, so an `eol=lf` policy would renormalise
#  them -- a huge diff on top of upstream's, and a conflict on every future
#  `git merge upstream/master`.  The "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings are
#  cosmetic; no file in this tree differs from HEAD by line endings alone.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Windows build tools.  The rules above name the unix binaries and miss the .exe
# siblings a Windows build produces.  generatebuiltinsl is a build tool, not part
# of the engine, so no target builds or cleans it.
engine/shaders/generatebuiltinsl.exe
engine/shaders/makevulkanblob.exe

# Local plugin/updater manifest, written by the running engine.
engine/installed.lst

